From 3e3fb5bdb6c9521dc8494aadf7628b4267fe5560 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 02:18:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Mod key mappings, key-pressed, open-player-menu and
 selected-slot (API 53)

A content mod declares keys in data/<mod>/horizon/key/<name>.json (label,
category, default key): they are in Controls under their category beside
vanilla's, rebound there and kept in horizon-mod-keys.txt. A press while
playing goes to the server on horizon:key and reaches the mod's new export
key-pressed. players.open-player-menu opens a menu over no item (the item
menu hooks, slot 4294967295); player-items.selected-slot gives the held
hotbar slot. Example item-menu-demo gains the tweaker key and menu.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RYe92n7spgy8vtm4CovRWA
